WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.213 --> 00:00:02.242
- I'm gonna struggle 
to the day I die

00:00:02.242 --> 00:00:06.485
of allowing yourself to 
look at glass half empty.

00:00:06.485 --> 00:00:09.582
I just feel like, 
now I understand, it's DNA

00:00:09.582 --> 00:00:11.913
and it's wiring and if you 
grow up with a mother

00:00:11.913 --> 00:00:14.152
who's extremely negative,
it's a really tough situation

00:00:14.152 --> 00:00:14.923
to break out of.

00:00:14.923 --> 00:00:16.592
It's just proven.
I've understood.

00:00:16.592 --> 00:00:19.241
You grow up in a 
tough town, I get it.

00:00:19.241 --> 00:00:21.032
There's a couple of 
issues with that.

00:00:21.032 --> 00:00:23.901
Number one, 
everybody's got stuff.

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:26.417
The problem is nobody cares.

00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:28.260
Once you understand 
that nobody cares

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.811
and you're 
complaining to empty air

00:00:30.811 --> 00:00:33.070
you start going in a little 
bit of a different direction

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:36.399
and, yeah, I try to, 
I like putting out positivity.

00:00:36.399 --> 00:00:41.009
The small minority of people 
that are mad and angry

00:00:41.009 --> 00:00:44.589
and hateful and 
dark are much louder

00:00:44.589 --> 00:00:46.860
than the big 
percentage of us that

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:50.208
are happy and 
excited and feel great.

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:52.087
And because the 
way technology works

00:00:52.087 --> 00:00:54.656
they are much louder than 
they've ever been before.

00:00:54.656 --> 00:00:56.720
And so I feel like 
as somebody who's got

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.747
full of bright 
light and happiness

00:00:58.747 --> 00:01:00.766
that I need to start getting 
louder about that as well

00:01:00.766 --> 00:01:02.757
'cause that's the only way 
we're gonna combat it.

00:01:02.757 --> 00:01:04.888
(applause)

00:01:10.455 --> 00:01:13.442
If that's the thing that's 
gonna get the loudest

00:01:13.442 --> 00:01:14.856
claps so far from 
this conversation,

00:01:14.856 --> 00:01:16.895
that's what we need 
to be focusing on.

00:01:16.895 --> 00:01:20.155
I feel more responsibility than 
ever as somebody who is happy

00:01:20.155 --> 00:01:23.153
and wants other people 
to be happy genuinely.

00:01:23.153 --> 00:01:25.025
If you leave with 
anything for any of us

00:01:25.025 --> 00:01:27.254
please take on a 
sense of responsibility

00:01:27.254 --> 00:01:29.553
that if you've got good 
and you feel good

00:01:29.553 --> 00:01:32.134
to start sharing 
that content as well

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:33.773
because the world 
needs more of it.

00:01:33.773 --> 00:01:35.703
(light music)

